            "content": "## Test data assumption: a Porter account with reviews\n\nRevinate has no sandbox. The connected Revinate Reputation account (username, Porter API key and API secret) must reach at least one hotel that has at least one review. The flow takes the first review Find Reviews returns, so no ID is hardcoded.\n\nThis flow has never been run: no Revinate test credentials existed when the connector was built."
